{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1486179-how-many-mooks-is-too-many","id":1486179,"title":"HOw many mooks is too many","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-07-10T13:52:04-07:00","id":1486179,"title":"HOw many mooks is too many","content":"I am running my first 2nd ed game at origin level I think I understand the tension pool but I can't find any design hints as to how many foes a group of scions should find challenging","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27242-ravynwinter","name":"Ravynwinter","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-10T16:29:35-07:00","id":1486184,"title":"","content":"It\u2019s very much dependent on the focus of the character powers.<br /> <br /> A combat focused team, with prepped relics can pretty much handle as many as you throw at them, but as a general rules I would make it 2-4 per character in a scene.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"at